{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-219-r2-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-219  Arrival times are shown in UTC instead of port time\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: eta   reported: 2026-09-01 by customer-service\n\nCustomers in Singapore were told their vessel arrives at noon when it actually arrives\nin the evening local time. The arrival stamp is supposed to be in the destination port's\nown time zone from the registry.\n\nAcceptance:\n  localArrival(new Date(\"2026-03-01T12:00:00Z\"), \"SGSIN\") returns \"2026-03-01 20:00\" and\n  for \"NLRTM\" returns \"2026-03-01 13:00\"; the format stays YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm and unknown\n  ports are still rejected.\n\nFiles:\n  src/eta/local.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_018vJGASsC8f9NLWzBniXbrN", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "2cd9303d-349f-476e-a9f3-e60db0117997", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:48:27.593Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-219  Arrival times are shown in UTC instead of port time\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: eta   reported: 2026-09-01 by customer-service\n\nCustomers in Singapore were told their vessel arrives at noon when it actually arrives\nin the evening local time. The arrival stamp is supposed to be in the destination port's\nown time zone from the registry.\n\nAcceptance:\n  localArrival(new Date(\"2026-03-01T12:00:00Z\"), \"SGSIN\") returns \"2026-03-01 20:00\" and\n  for \"NLRTM\" returns \"2026-03-01 13:00\"; the format stays YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm and unknown\n  ports are still rejected.\n\nFiles:\n  src/eta/local.ts"}, "type": "user"}
